title: XenServer / XCP-ng: VM interface
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check shows the throughput of a virtual network interface (VIF) of a
 VM, its network and MAC address. Data comes from the special agent
 {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service per virtual interface. The item is the VIF device number.
